function pasteSegment(trackId,time){if(editingBusy()||!clipboard)return;if(!sources.has(clipboard.source)){notify('El audio copiado ya no está disponible en esta sesión.',true);return;}const t=project.tracks.find(t=>t.id===trackId);if(!t)return;stash();const c={...clipboard,id:id(),start:Math.max(0,time),points:[...(clipboard.points||[])],volumePoints:(clipboard.volumePoints||[]).map(p=>({...p}))};t.clips.push(c);selectedClip=c.id;selectedTrack=t.id;project.region=null;previewPlan=null;dirty();render();refreshAudio();notify('Segmento pegado.');}
